    "Name": "Excalibur EXC-B1",
    "Details": "The <i>Excalibur</i> BattleMech was designed to blend range and mobility, boasting an impressive top speed for its tonnage. The name comes from the unique appearance of its lower right arm actuator, reminiscent of a medieval Terran sword. The B1 was the first model of <i>Excalibur</i> to be produced and served as a solid basis for all models to follow.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Breaching Shot</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.1</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
